+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Query params declared with `p.json()` are now serialized with `JSON.stringify` instead of `String(value)`. Passing an object (e.g. `{ configOverrides: { foo: 1 } }`) previously sent `configOverrides=[object Object]`, which the server's `JSON()` template function rejected with `Error parsing JSON: '[object Object]'`. Arrays of objects are likewise serialized as a single JSON string; arrays of primitives (Array params) are unchanged.
+
